%% Figure 4.4 — Diagnose sequence diagram (POST /api/diagnose)
%% JC2001 Group 5 / StudyGraph Smart Study Assistant / Chapter 4.2.2
%% 
%% Design constraints (do not violate):
%%   1. The main diagnosis path (inside the rectangle) contains no external service: no Neo4j and no model call.
%%      This follows the branch structure of backend/app/services/diagnostic_service.py -- the decision only performs in-memory
%%      dictionary lookups and field assembly, hence P95 < 5 ms and fully offline.
%%   2. Neo4j Aura does not appear in this figure. It serves only the offline evaluation path (AD-05);
%%      drawing it into the online sequence would contradict the assertions in section 4.2.2.
%%   3. The model (Qwen-Turbo) is called optionally only when "generating a hint after a wrong answer", gated by
%%      QWEN_API_KEY and falling back to local seed copy after a 4.0 s timeout; it is a hint enhancer,
%%      not part of the diagnosis path, and its failure does not change the verdict.
%%   4. Interface fields come from backend/app/models/diagnose.py: request question_id + selected_option;
%%      response is_correct / trap_id / trap_title / concept_name / prerequisite /
%%      socratic_guidance / radar_dimension / score_delta / fallback_mode / model_used.
%%   5. Three fallback exits (question not found / invalid parameters / unexpected exception) guarantee no 500 is thrown.
%% 
%% Rendering notes: a comment line must not be just "%%"; write "%% " instead; node/participant names must not contain ASCII parentheses.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant UI as Frontend app.js
    participant API as Router Layer
    participant Svc as Diagnostic Service
    participant Bank as Question Bank

    User->>UI: Clicks a distractor option (e.g. B)
    UI->>API: POST /api/diagnose

    rect rgb(240, 247, 255)
    Note over API,Bank: Main diagnosis path · pure in-memory lookup · no network · no model · no database
    API->>API: Pydantic validation
    alt Validation passed
        API->>Svc: diagnose_answer
        Svc->>Bank: Fetch question by question_id
        alt Question found
            Bank-->>Svc: QuizItem
            Svc->>Svc: Locate option by selected_key
            Svc->>Bank: traps[trap_id] lookup
            Bank-->>Svc: TrapDetail four fields
            Svc-->>API: DiagnoseResponse
        else Question not found
            Svc-->>API: Emergency fallback response
        end
    else Validation failed
        API-->>UI: 422 validation error
    end
    end

    API-->>UI: 200 OK · is_correct + trap four fields + radar_dimension

    opt Wrong answer only and QWEN_API_KEY configured · 4.0 s timeout
        Svc->>Svc: Generate hint
        Note over Svc: On failure or timeout fall back to local copy; the verdict is unaffected
    end

    UI->>UI: Expand the diagnosis drawer
    UI-->>User: Show the trap, prerequisite theorem and hint
    UI->>UI: Write to localStorage and update the radar
